<SCENARIO VER="105">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<TXSPN>Shiyo 802, April 7　6:00―<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "togisuma.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\肉付き\処置室.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
10 hours have passed since I lay down on the bed in the treatment room.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It's already nearly dawn.<PG>
There's no one in the other beds, and the treatment room is filled with an unfamiliar aromatic scent.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
An aroma mist is <STYLE ID="1" RUBY="た">diffusing</STYLE> so that I can relax, even a little.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Apparently an exchange transfusion can cause side effects, but so far there are no symptoms I can feel.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\sliding_wooden_door_C.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, how are you feeling?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Yeah, I'm fine so far. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, this method is going to work, right?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Humankind built civilization by repeating experiment after experiment. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">If you think of this exchange transfusion as one more step in that buildup, it isn't wasted."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"You're right. It won't end up wasted, will it..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Yes, I'm sure it'll be <TXSPS>fi... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">fwa... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">fwaah..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2"><TXSPN>Goto</STYLE> gives a huge yawn.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What with looking after me and running around for <STYLE ID="4">Haruka</STYLE>, her fatigue and sleepiness must have <STYLE ID="1" RUBY="た">piled</STYLE> up.<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, you should go rest at your own place soon. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">I think the one who's most tired right now is you, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">You'll end up collapsing like me, okay?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島考えるバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Come to think of it... I haven't slept at all since </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Niimura-senpai's</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> frenzy began."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"I'm going to be like this for a while longer anyway. Go home and rest."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"All right. I've been telling you to rest this whole time, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, so it'd be weird if I didn't do it myself. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, I'll come back around when your exchange transfusion is done. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">About 10 more hours, maybe?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Yeah, but don't worry about the time. Take proper care of yourself."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島挨拶バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Okay! Then I'll head home for now! Good night!"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\sliding_wooden_door_C.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">Goto</STYLE> left the room.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Now that I thought about it, <STYLE ID="2">Goto</STYLE> was in and out of the hospital in the middle of the night, even though she was a high-school student.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It struck me all over again how much the doctors must trust her.<PG>
I have to rest properly too...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Honestly, I'm anxious about what effect the exchange transfusion will have on my body.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I mean to sleep, but the sleepiness won't come.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "5000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
In the bright treatment room, I try closing my eyes.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It'd be nice if I could fall asleep like this...<PG>
―But maybe it's because I've been awake for so long too.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
As you'd expect, sleepiness is starting to win out over my anxiety.<PG>
On top of that, the scent of this aroma brings on a gentle drowsiness.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<TXSPS>Like this... I might be able to sleep...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If I sleep like this... and wake up... 
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">Haruka</STYLE> will surely be cured.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It'll be okay... 
{PAUSE ""}
Get some proper sleep... I...<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<TXSPN>Shiyo 802, April 7　15:00―<PG>
"―<STYLE ID="3">Kogori-san</STYLE>, it's finished."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A man's voice, faintly heard.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "最後の声・真呪殺\夕焼け.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\肉付き\処置室.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
When I open my eyes, there in my view is that doctor.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
As I come to, the aromatic scent of the aroma mist drifts faintly through my nose.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It looks like I've been asleep for a very long time. Maybe it's thanks to this scent.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I slept straight through without even dreaming.<PG>
"Total time, 19 hours. The exchange transfusion is complete. 
{PAUSE ""}
How are you feeling?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"I have a bit of a headache... maybe from sleeping too much..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Do you have any nausea or fatigue?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Nothing like that... not really..."</STYLE><PG>
―After that, I'm checked for side effects of the exchange transfusion.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
My head's foggy, but other than that there's no particular problem.<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"How is </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> doing?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"As for that, I think it would be better to explain after you have checked on <STYLE ID="4">Niimura-san's</STYLE> condition. 
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Goto-san</STYLE> is here as well, so the two of you together."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The doctor won't even say whether she's cured or not.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I can't really tell right now what that means, but...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I decide to go to <STYLE ID="4">Haruka's</STYLE> hospital room now and see for myself how things turned out.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "SE\sliding_wooden_door_C.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\心電図.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "600" "5000" "PASS"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\肉付き\春花病室昼.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島うつむき逆.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "4" "2000" "960" "1" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Oh, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Good morning, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">though I guess it's too late in the day for that. Did you get some good rest?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島挨拶バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Yes! I'm fully recovered, thank you!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Goto's</STYLE> bright, cheerful reply.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Is this behavior of <STYLE ID="2">Goto's</STYLE> a positive take on the situation, or is she pushing herself?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I can't tell from this alone.<PG>
As for <STYLE ID="4">Haruka</STYLE>... 
{PAUSE ""}
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "3000" "PASS"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\真呪殺\肉付き\春花人工呼吸.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
She seems to be asleep, still on the ventilator.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Huh?
{PAUSE ""}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
　The anesthesia should have worn off by now, and yet the ventilator...?<PG>
"Now then, since <STYLE ID="3">Kogori-san</STYLE> is here as well, I will explain <STYLE ID="4">Niimura-san's</STYLE> condition."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
When the doctor says this, the cheerful <STYLE ID="2">Goto's</STYLE> eyes turn sharp.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
At the same time, tension runs through the room.<PG>
"Frankly speaking... 
{PAUSE ""}
where things stand, all we can say is 'we don't know'..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"You don't know...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\Erica.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
"<STYLE ID="4">Niimura-san</STYLE> should have come out of the anesthesia by now, but you can see how she is. 
{PAUSE ""}
The anesthesia was strong enough to cause a loss of reflexes, so she is unable to breathe by herself. 
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">Niimura-san</STYLE> is still unchanged. She cannot breathe on her own."<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"You mean she should be waking up from the anesthesia, but she isn't?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"In a case like <STYLE ID="4">Niimura-san's</STYLE>, where the condition was critical to begin with, it is possible for the anesthesia to take longer to wear off. 
{PAUSE ""}
If that is so, she will probably start breathing before long, but... 
{PAUSE ""}
if the anesthesia has been a strain on <STYLE ID="4">Niimura-san</STYLE>, there is also a chance she will stay unable to breathe..."<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"So you mean we can't tell whether </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Kogori-senpai's</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> exchange transfusion worked?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Until <STYLE ID="4">Niimura-san's</STYLE> breathing returns, we cannot make that judgment."<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"Doctor... if you hadn't used the anesthesia, what would have happened?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"She has torn muscles all over, and her whole body is in tatters. 
{PAUSE ""}
If we had let her keep thrashing like that, I believe she would be in a very dangerous state by now... 
{PAUSE ""}
So as far as protecting <STYLE ID="4">Niimura-san's</STYLE> life goes, I believe this was the best course of action."<PG>
Either way, this was the only way, then...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If she died, the chance of her waking was zero.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Right now, the odds were as close to zero as they could be―or were they?<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"What will happen if she stays in this state?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"If she continues to be unable to breathe on her own, we will make an incision in her throat and attach a different ventilator. 
{PAUSE ""}
She will probably no longer be able to get out of bed at all..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"No...! You mean she won't even be able to go for walks in the wheelchair!?"</STYLE><PG>
"I am afraid so... 
{PAUSE ""}
No, it has not been decided that this state will continue. 
{PAUSE ""}
What remains is... how hard <STYLE ID="4">Niimura-san</STYLE> can fight."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Hey, </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, can you hear me!?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">　Hurry... hurry and come back...!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">　Even just breathing is enough! Then we can go outside and take walks again...!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">　Again... let me hear your voice, even if it's a lie...!"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, you can't get impatient now. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">First, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, let's get you outside. It's a little windy today, so we can check whether the exchange transfusion worked. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Let's take it little by little, starting with what we can do."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Yeah... you're right..."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "SE" "3000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
―With <STYLE ID="2">Goto</STYLE> pushing my wheelchair, I head for the roof.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
On the way, <STYLE ID="2">Goto</STYLE> and I don't talk.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I can't even tell whether things are heading somewhere good now or have gotten worse.<PG>
{STOPSND "BGM" "5000" "PASS"}
No... if we hadn't put <STYLE ID="4">Haruka</STYLE> to sleep, by now...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I try to switch my thoughts to something even a little more positive, but the hopeless picture of the future keeps threatening to crush me.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{WAITPLAY "BGM" "CLICK"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\誰もいない校舎で.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\肉付き\病院屋上からの風景.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
On the roof, a warm wind.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The weather has been very nice lately.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Even though it's spring, when the weather changes so easily, the wind is gentle and it doesn't rain.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
As if enjoying that peaceful weather, the cherry trees below sway in the wind.<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, if you start to feel even a little sick, please tell me. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Also if, by any chance, you sense danger."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Okay... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">If I stay well like this and don't feel any danger, that means my April sickness is cured, right?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"That's right. If so, I don't think </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Niimura-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> will thrash around even when she wakes up."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"I see... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Then it'll be okay whenever </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> wakes up!"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Right now is a period of preparation while we wait for </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Niimura-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> to wake. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">We'd better get fully ready while we can."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Goto</STYLE> says hopeful things.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I go along with it and smile at <STYLE ID="2">Goto</STYLE>.<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"I have something I want to do. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">―when she wakes up... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">I want to take a photo together with her."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"A photo?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Yeah... a family photo."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"That sounds great! I'll be the photographer!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">　If </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Kogori-senpai's</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> April sickness is cured, taking it under the goshinboku would be nice too!"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"Under the goshinboku, huh... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">I've never gone near cherry trees on my own, so it feels a little strange."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"How do the cherry blossoms strike you?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">　Do you still... hate cherry blossoms?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"I don't know... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Right now... it's neither, I guess... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">I don't feel like I like them or hate them."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Just not hating them is big progress!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">　I'm sure </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Senpai's</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> April sickness is getting better too!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Yeah, I really think so!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">　I think someday I'll even be able to like cherry blossoms!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">　And together with </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">..."</STYLE><PG>
The gentle wind keeps blowing without pause.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
On the roof, that wind feels all the stronger.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A wall of sheets hung to dry on the roof billows in big waves.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Only the flapping of the sheets and the sound of the wind echo across the roof.<PG>
Just then, my nose, <STYLE ID="5" RUBY="まひ">numbed</STYLE> by the scent in the treatment room, catches a certain smell.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A nice smell.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A smell I must have always been breathing―
{PAUSE ""}
it should be a nice smell, but I don't have many good memories of it.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That's it. This smell must be―<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "5000" "PASS"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\肉付き\病院屋上.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">... even the wind has a smell, huh."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Huh?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Until now, the cherry blossom season always felt kind of suffocating. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">I never breathed in the air as deeply as I could. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Now I get it. It gets warm, all kinds of life sprout, and the smell of that life comes carried on the wind."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, that means..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "Lucky_You.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="3">"This spring wind feels so good. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">While it's still this season, I want to go for a walk with </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> again. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">I won't be so </STYLE><STYLE ID="6" RUBY="ぜいたく">greedy</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> as to tell her to wake up right away, but... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">it's a gentle wind, the kind that lets me dream a dream like that."</STYLE><PG>
For the first time, I understand how glad so many people feel at the arrival of spring.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The scent of young leaves not yet fully <STYLE ID="7" RUBY="も">budded</STYLE>―
{PAUSE ""}
the warm wind carried up from the south―
{PAUSE ""}
the bright spirits of people giddy with spring―
{PAUSE ""}
and the faint smell of cherry blossoms.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It's so refreshing and pleasant.<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"The exchange transfusion seems to have worked."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島怒りバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"R-really!? You don't feel sick!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Yeah."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYMOVIE "111.wmv" "256" "C" "C" "REPEAT" "FALSE" "200" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n50\r\n3000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
