{MESON "500"}
I stand up from the wheelchair and look out from the roof at the view below.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The vivid contrast of the rapeseed blossoms, the cherry blossoms, and the young leaves―
{PAUSE ""}
a beautiful world I'd always turned my eyes away from spreads out before me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
So this world was <STYLE ID="8" RUBY="あふ">overflowing</STYLE> with views this beautiful.<PG>
If <STYLE ID="4">Haruka</STYLE> hadn't fallen into a <STYLE ID="9" RUBY="こんすい">coma</STYLE>―
{PAUSE ""}
if <STYLE ID="2">Goto</STYLE> hadn't supported me all this time―
{PAUSE ""}
I would never have seen this view.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I've been led out into a new world.<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, thank you. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">For showing me a new world."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Goto</STYLE> gently wraps her arms around my back as I look down over the world.<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"I'm the one who got shown a new world by you, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, being able to see a new world together with you... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">being able to be together in a new world... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">makes me happy."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"I never led you, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, out into a new world or anything..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, if I hadn't met you, I'm sure I'd still be lonely and abject now. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Without ever finding where I belong, even now, all this time..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"That's because you, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, supported me in middle school. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">All I did was get supported. The one who carved out a new world was you yourself, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">But if I could be what started it, I'm glad."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Heh heh. Please stay with me from now on too. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">My new world needs you, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Of course... </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Niimura-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> too."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"My new world needs you, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, and </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> too. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">I'm sure </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> will come here too, right?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Yes! She'll definitely come!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The pleasant spring wind carries hope to me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If this wind makes me feel positive, it's worth more than any danger sense.<PG>
I still don't know whether I've lost my danger sense too, but...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
if I got this new world in exchange for it, then I think it was for the best.<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Shall we head back soon? You've had enough time in the wind."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Yeah, I want to tell </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> right away!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"I'm sure </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Niimura-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> will be glad! She was always worried about </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Senpai's</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> April sickness."</STYLE><PG>
