{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
In <STYLE ID="4">Haruka's</STYLE> hospital room, the doctor and a nurse were standing beside the bed.<PG>
"Ah, <STYLE ID="3">Kogori-san</STYLE>, good timing. 
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Kogori-san</STYLE>, after one more week in the hospital, you will be fine to be discharged. 
{PAUSE ""}
Your blood test and your stomach are both fine now. The drug in question was not detected either."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Really!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"However, for observation, you will come in 3 times a week through the end of April, and your part-time job is off-limits as well."<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"My job too... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">All right. I'll be coming to check on </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> anyway."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島考えるバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, uh..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"I know. I'll keep my visits to </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> to 3 times a week too."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島挨拶バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Then I'm relieved!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">　So... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">Niimura-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">―how is she doing?"</STYLE><PG>
"It is only little by little, but she has started showing reflex responses."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Really!? Does that mean she's getting better!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"You may take that positively. 
{PAUSE ""}
Let us continue to observe how far she recovers from here."<PG>
Hearing that, <STYLE ID="2">Goto</STYLE> and I look at each other with joy on our faces.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Little by little, little by little, my new world is taking shape.<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"Um, Doctor... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Could I stay the night in this room tonight?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"<STYLE ID="3">Kogori-san</STYLE>, in this room...?
{PAUSE ""}
　But if <STYLE ID="4">Niimura-san's</STYLE> frenzy were to start again..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
