―A cot for me was set up next to <STYLE ID="4">Haruka</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Before long the sun set, and the three of us, <STYLE ID="2">Goto</STYLE> included, stayed together until the very end of visiting hours.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
There's no room for <STYLE ID="2">Goto</STYLE> to stay over as well, so tonight it's me and <STYLE ID="4">Haruka</STYLE>, just the two of us.<PG>
Shiyo 802, April 7　20:00―<PG>
