{MESON "500"}
Until a little while ago, <STYLE ID="2">Goto</STYLE> had been eagerly talking to <STYLE ID="4">Haruka</STYLE> too.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What the three of us talked about was nothing but trivial things.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But unlike before, it was the kind of conversation we always had 2 years ago.<PG>
<STYLE ID="4">Haruka</STYLE>, too, hearing our voices, will probably want to wake up soon.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If that stimulates <STYLE ID="4">Haruka</STYLE> and keeps her heading in a good direction, nothing could make me happier.<PG>
―At the corners of <STYLE ID="4">Haruka's</STYLE> eyes, I try a gentle <STYLE ID="10" RUBY="な">stroke</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
At that, the corners of her eyes move faintly.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Just a little, I try tickling near <STYLE ID="4">Haruka's</STYLE> ear.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
At that, goosebumps rise, just a little.<PG>
<STYLE ID="4">Haruka</STYLE> is still on the ventilator.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But <STYLE ID="4">Haruka</STYLE> is definitely alive.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Alive, and reacting to my hand.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Without any of that frenzy, she just sleeps, quietly and peacefully.<PG>
I sit on the cot, which is lower than <STYLE ID="4">Haruka's</STYLE> bed, and bring my face close to <STYLE ID="4">Haruka's</STYLE> hand.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I can't tune out the busy hum of the ventilator.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Right now she can't live without this machine's help, but... 
{PAUSE ""}
even so, I believe she'll get better.<PG>
With my face down on <STYLE ID="4">Haruka's</STYLE> bed, drowsiness gradually comes over me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I only woke up in the late afternoon, but maybe because it's spring now, I'm very sleepy.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Spring, the season I used to loathe, now gives my heart peace and invites me into a gentle sleep.<PG>
My eyelids grow heavy, and with my face close to <STYLE ID="4">Haruka's</STYLE> hand, I eventually close my eyes.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Believing that when I open these eyes again, <STYLE ID="4">Haruka</STYLE> will be even better―
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Good night, <STYLE ID="4">Haruka</STYLE>...
